# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: ice. Almost no grip: you coast, and steering takes a long time to bite.
# Grippy pads at each corner are the only places you can stop.
name: Thin Ice
time: 75
theme: madness
story: Nothing here holds you back.
story: That is the problem. Steer early, and gently.
